  "title": "Italian Spinach and Pasta Soup",
  "blurb": "A simple, warming soup with pasta and spinach in a herb-scented vegetable broth.",
  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat and add the sliced garlic. Cook for one minute until fragrant but not browned.",
    "Pour in the vegetable stock and bring to the boil. Add the oregano, basil, black pepper and salt.",
    "Add the pasta and simmer for 8 to 10 minutes until nearly tender, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the spinach and cook for 2 to 3 minutes until wilted. Taste and adjust the seasoning if needed.",
    "Ladle into bowls and serve immediately."
